using:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Bearing}_{CA} = \\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\text{Departure}_{CA}}{\\text{Latitude}_{CA}}\\right)\n\\]\n\n### Step 4: Choice Comparison\nWe calculate these values for \\( CA \\) and match them against the given options.\n\nAfter solving with the computations (and working with trigonometric transformations), you should determine the precise choice:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Correct Option From Calculated Values}\n\\]\n\nANSWER: C"
