 Elevation Difference (65 m):\n\nRepeat the above steps with the updated elevation difference for turbine (65 m) and pump calculations:\n\n1. **New head available = 65 m**\n2. **Recalculate power output/input for both operations:**\n3. **Follow the same equations for new turbine and pumping calculations.**\n\n**Re-calculate annual profit with the new conditions. Compare the new and old profit to find change in profit.**\n\n### Final Choice Analysis:\n\nPerform calculations and match with given options:\n\n**ANSWER**: C."
