est logical leads through similarity of angular segments there is:\n\n6. **Correct Option:**\n   - Based on recalibration with calculated estimates, the closest valid significant force magnitudes to resolved vectorial configuration become opt. B:\n     \\[\n     \\text{Tension calculated previously approximately reviews T manhandled as}\\approx 26.02 \\text{ kips in such setup}\n     \\]\n\nThus, conforming to the choice given prefixed conclusions with confidence:\n\n\\[ \\text{ANSWER: B.} \\]"
