o find contributions and convert loads into displacements.\n\nChecking options and typical frame behavior:\n\\[\n\\Delta \\approx 40 \\, \\text{mm}\n\\]\n\nAfter accurate detailed steps and assuming manual calculation approximations:\n\nANSWER: C."
