"To compute the new values of `estimatedRTT`, `DevRTT`, and the TCP timeout for each measured RTT, we use these formulas:\n\n1. **Update `estimatedRTT`:**\n   \\[\n   \\text{estimatedRTT} = (1 - \\alpha) \\times \\text{estimatedRTT} + \\alpha \\times \\text{SampleRTT}\n   \\]\n\n2. **Update `DevRTT`:**\n   \\[\n   \\text{DevRTT} = (1 - \\beta) \\times \\text{DevRTT} + \\beta \\times |\\text{SampleRTT} - \\text{estimatedRTT}|\n   \\]\n\n3. **Timeout Interval:**\n   \\[\n   \\text{TimeoutInterval} = \\text{estimatedRTT} + 4 \\times \\text{DevRTT}\n   \\]\n\nGiven:\n- Initial `estimatedRTT` = 250 msec\n- Initial `DevRTT` = 38 msec\n- \\(\\alpha = 0.125\\)\n- \\(\\beta = 0.25\\)\n- SampleRTTs = 280 msec, 200 msec, 340 msec\n\nLet's compute these step-by-step for each SampleRTT.\n\n### 1. For SampleRTT = 280 msec:\n- **New `estimatedRTT`:**\n  \\[\n  \\text{estimatedRTT} = (1 - 0.125) \\times 250 + 0.125 \\times 280 = 253.75 \\text{ msec}\n  \\]\n\n- **New `DevRTT`:**\n  \\[\n  \\text{DevRTT} = (1 - 0.25) \\times 38 + 0.25 \\times |280 - 253.75| = 38.56 \\text{ msec}\n  \\]\n\n- **Timeout Interval:**\n  \\[\n  \\text{TimeoutInterval} = 253.75 + 4 \\times 38.56 = 408.99 \\text{ msec}\n  \\]\n\n### 2. For SampleRTT = 200 msec:\n- **New `estimatedRTT`:**\n  \\[\n  \\text{estimatedRTT} = (1 - 0.125) \\times 253.75 + 0.125 \\times 200 = 247.81 \\text{ msec}\n  \\]\n\n- **New `DevRTT`:**\n  \\[\n  \\text{DevRTT} = (1 - 0.25) \\times 38.56 + 0.25 \\times |200 - 247.81| = 41.43 \\text{ msec}\n  \\]\n\n- **Timeout Interval:**\n  \\[\n  \\text{TimeoutInterval} = 247.81 + 4 \\times 41.43 = 413.53 \\text{ msec}\n  \\]\n\n### 3. For SampleRTT = 340 msec:\n- **New `estimatedRTT`:**\n  \\[\n  \\text{estimatedRTT} = (1 - 0.125) \\times 247.81 + 0.125 \\times 340 = 258.59 \\text{ msec}\n  \\]\n\n- **New `DevRTT`:**\n  \\[\n  \\text{DevRTT} = (1 - 0.25) \\times 41.43 + 0.25 \\times |340 - 258.59| = 51.56 \\text{ msec}\n  \\]\n\n- **Timeout Interval:**\n  \\[\n  \\text{TimeoutInterval} = 258.59 + 4 \\times 51.56 = 464.83 \\text{ msec}\n  \\]\n\nFor the first RTT, the TimeoutInterval is 408.99 msec.\n\nANSWER: A"
