"To solve this problem, we need to calculate the economic capital for each business unit separately and then combine them, considering the correlations.\n\n### Step 1: Calculate Economic Capital for Each Business Unit\n\n#### Business Unit 1:\n- Market Risk: 20\n- Credit Risk: 40\n- Operational Risk: 70\n\nEconomic capital (EC) is usually calculated as:\n\n\\[\nEC = \\sqrt{\\sum_{i} \\sum_{j} \\rho_{ij} \\cdot risk_i \\cdot risk_j}\n\\]\n\nFor Business Unit 1:\n\n\\[\nEC_{1} = \\sqrt{20^2 + 40^2 + 70^2 + 2 \\times 0.2 \\times 20 \\times 40 + 2 \\times 0.5 \\times 20 \\times 70 + 2 \\times 0.3 \\times 40 \\times 70}\n\\]\n\n\\[\nEC_{1} = \\sqrt{400 + 1600 + 4900 + 320 + 1400 + 840}\n\\]\n\\[\nEC_{1} = \\sqrt{9460} \\approx 97.23\n\\]\n\n#### Business Unit 2:\n- Market Risk: 40\n- Credit Risk: 30\n- Operational Risk: 10\n\nFor Business Unit 2:\n\n\\[\nEC_{2} = \\sqrt{40^2 + 30^2 + 10^2 + 2 \\times 0.2 \\times 40 \\times 30 + 2 \\times 0.5 \\times 40 \\times 10 + 2 \\times 0.3 \\times 30 \\times 10}\n\\]\n\n\\[\nEC_{2} = \\sqrt{1600 + 900 + 100 + 480 + 400 + 90}\n\\]\n\\[\nEC_{2} = \\sqrt{3570} \\approx 59.74\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Calculate Total Economic Capital for Both Units\n\nWe combine the two units, taking the correlation into account. The correlation between the overall economic capitals of the two units is 0.65.\n\n\\[\nEC_{\\text{total}} = \\sqrt{EC_{1}^2 + EC_{2}^2 + 2 \\times 0.65 \\times EC_{1} \\times EC_{2}}\n\\]\n\n\\[\nEC_{\\text{total}} = \\sqrt{97.23^2 + 59.74^2 + 2 \\times 0.65 \\times 97.23 \\times 59.74}\n\\]\n\n\\[\nEC_{\\text{total}} = \\sqrt{9454.63 + 3568.51 + 7483.041}\n\\]\n\n\\[\nEC_{\\text{total}} = \\sqrt{20506.181} \\approx 143.22\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\nThe closest choice, based on calculated results, is not found in the options provided. It appears there is a mistake because the calculated total is approximately 143.22, which does not match any options exactly.\n\nBased on the available choices and assuming approximate values, the closest pre-calculation likely matches with:\nANSWER: D."
