sualization, reducing \\( i \\):\n\nEstimate from reasonably clear flow segments, approximating 4 layers/spans between points (assuming clarity in the given layers and formatting):\n\n\\[\ni \\approx 0.55\n\\]\n\n### Conclusion:\nThe maximum average hydraulic gradient derived in accordance to the figure tracing leads to:\n\nANSWER: B. 0.55."
