ods, excluding automotives: 107.4\n- Nonmanufactured consumer goods: 115.6\n\n**Ordered List for October 2012:**\n- Natural gas: 81.1\n- Consumer goods, excluding automotives: 107.4\n- Paper and paper-base stocks: 112.7\n- Automotive vehicles, parts, and engines: 115.2\n- Nonmanufactured consumer goods: 115.6\n- All imports, excluding petroleum: 116.3\n- Electric generating equipment: 119.5\n- Nonagricultural foods (fish, distilled beverages): 120.6\n- Selected building materials: 141.3\n- Foods, feeds, and beverages: 172.2\n- Industrial supplies and materials: 259.8\n- Petroleum and petroleum products: 393.0\n- Crude oil: 402.5\n\nMedian for October = Electric generating equipment: 119.5\n\nThe median indices for September and October are both for Electric generating equipment.\n\nANSWER: A. True."
