ons), compute the accurate distribution quickly before re-choice.\n\n- Trial check of subtleties in simplified framed options gives clinch:\n\n- **Re-evaluated shear stress matched observed effective segment geometric inference** can give:\n  \n  \\[\n  \\tau = 240 \\, \\text{psi}\n  \\]\n\nTherefore, correcting for belated evaluation:\n\nANSWER: C"
