( N_E=-323 \\text{ lb}, V_E=100 \\text{ lb}, M_E=300 \\text{ lb} \\cdot \\text{ft} \\)\n\nAfter calculation, **Option A** matches an accurate calculation based on correct assumptions and mechanical analysis. \n\n### Conclusion:\n\nANSWER: A"
