    - Move to \\( j \\), add edge \\( cj \\).\n\n16. **Visit \\( j \\):**\n    - Next choose \\( k \\).\n    - Move to \\( k \\), add edge \\( jk \\).\n\n17. **Visit \\( k \\):**\n    - From \\( k \\), visit \\( m \\).\n    - Move to \\( m \\), add edge \\( km \\).\n\n18. **Visit \\( m \\):**\n    - From \\( m \\), visit \\( n \\).\n    - Move to \\( n \\), add edge \\( mn \\).\n\n19. **Visit \\( n \\):**\n    - From \\( n \\), visit \\( p \\).\n    - Move to \\( p \\), add edge \\( np \\).\n\nAll vertices are visited. The DFS tree edges in DFS order are:\n\nab, bc, ce, de, cf, fg, fh, fi, cj, jk, km, mn, np.\n\nANSWER: A"
