2}\\right)^2 = \\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{8}\n   \\]\n\nIn reconsidering any overlooked integral computations, the given options are checked. The area calculation corresponds to:\n\\[ \n\\frac{9}{16}\\sqrt{3} \n\\]\nThus, the correct choice is:\n\\[ \n\\text{ANSWER: E} \n\\]"
