"To determine the natural frequencies and mode shapes of the system, consider the following:\n\n1. **Model the system**: Treat each mass as a point mass attached to sections of the string. The tension in the string is \\(T\\), and each section of the string is rigid with lengths \\(l_1 = l_2 = l_3 = l\\).\n\n2. **Determine the equations of motion**: For small oscillations, apply Newton\u2019s second law to each mass:\n   - For \\(m_1\\):\n     \\[\n     m \\frac{d^2x_1}{dt^2} = T\\left(\\frac{x_2 - x_1}{l}\\right) - T\\left(\\frac{x_1}{l}\\right)\n     \\]\n     Simplifies to:\n     \\[\n     m \\frac{d^2x_1}{dt^2} = \\frac{T}{l}(x_2 - 2x_1)\n     \\]\n\n   - For \\(m_2\\):\n     \\[\n     m \\frac{d^2x_2}{dt^2} = -T\\left(\\frac{x_2 - x_1}{l}\\right)\n     \\]\n     Simplifies to:\n     \\[\n     m \\frac{d^2x_2}{dt^2} = \\frac{T}{l}(x_1 - x_2)\n     \\]\n\n3. **Formulate and solve the eigenvalue problem**: Write the equations in matrix form:\n   \\[\n   m \\begin{bmatrix} \\ddot{x}_1 \\\\ \\ddot{x}_2 \\end{bmatrix} = \\frac{T}{l} \\begin{bmatrix} -2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} x_1 \\\\ x_2 \\end{bmatrix}\n   \\]\n   Assume solutions of the form \\(x_i(t) = X_i e^{i\\omega t}\\) to get the eigenvalue problem:\n   \\[\n   \\begin{bmatrix} -2 - \\frac{m\\omega^2 l}{T} & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 - \\frac{m\\omega^2 l}{T} \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} X_1 \\\\ X_2 \\end{bmatrix} = 0\n   \\]\n   Solving for \\( \\omega^2 \\), find:\n   \\[\n   \\left( -2 - \\frac{m\\omega^2 l}{T} \\right)\\left(-1 - \\frac{m\\omega^2 l}{T}\\right) - 1 = 0\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   2 + 3\\frac{m\\omega^2 l}{T} + \\left(\\frac{m\\omega^2 l}{T}\\right)^2 = 0\n   \\]\n   Solving this quadratic equation gives the eigenvalues:\n   \\[\n   \\omega_1 = \\sqrt{\\frac{T}{ml}} \\quad \\text{and} \\quad \\omega_2 = \\sqrt{3}\\sqrt{\\frac{T}{ml}}\n   \\]\n\nThus, the natural frequencies are:\n- \\( \\omega_1 = \\sqrt{\\frac{T}{ml}} \\)\n- \\( \\omega_2 = \\sqrt{3}\\sqrt{\\frac{T}{ml}} \\)\n\nComparing with the given options, we find that:\n- Option C matches because \\( \\sqrt{3} \\approx 1.732 \\).\n\nANSWER: C"
